---
pageType: page
title: "Contact Monthaven Home Buyers | Gaston & Cleveland County NC"
description: "Call, text, or email Monthaven Home Buyers. We buy houses for cash across Gaston, Cleveland and Lincoln County, North Carolina."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Contact"
    url: "/contact/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      The fastest way to get an answer is to call or send a text. A person picks up.
      Calls and texts go to two different numbers, both below.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--split">
    <div class="stack-lg">
      <div>
        <h2>Call</h2>
        <p class="lead"><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a></p>
        <p class="small muted">{{ site.businessHours }}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Text</h2>
        <p class="lead"><a href="sms:{{ site.smsRaw }}">{{ site.smsDisplay }}</a></p>
        <p class="small muted">
          A different number from the one above, and not a mistake. Texts go to the line that
          is set up to read and answer them, so a message here gets to us properly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p class="lead"><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Where we work</h2>
        <p>
          Gaston, Cleveland, and Lincoln counties, North Carolina. We're a service-area
          business, so we come to the property rather than asking you to come to an office.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/service-areas/">See every city we buy in &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Just want a number?</h2>
        <p>
          Use the form. You'll have a written offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours
          and there's no obligation attached to it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      {{ leadForm("contact-form", "full", null, null, "Tell us about the property") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
